              timestamp: Date.now(),
            });
          } catch (_) {}
        }
        // Audit: capture this run's RECIPE (Step 2 reached). Pull OARS meta
        // fresh for cpRef/thirdParty/entity; merge the stashed Step 1
        // answers. Never let capture failure affect the fill flow.
        // Mark fill done BEFORE the audit capture so the stepsDone snapshot
        // reflects it (the snapshot reads _bdCompleted.templates).
